save_compchem.method

    _definition.id                '_compchem.method'
    _alias.definition_id          '_compchem_method'
    _definition.update            2026-04-24
    _description.text
    ;
    The energy or scoring model used to rank structures.

    Examples:
    Forcefield
    ;
    _name.category_id             '_compchem'
    _name.object_id               'method'
    _type.purpose                 State
    _type.source                  Assigned
    _type.container               Single
    _type.contents                Text
    loop_                      
        _enumeration_set.state 
        _enumeration_set.detail
        'pDFT (Sec. 4.2)'                        ' Ranking methods based on periodic Density Functional'
        'Forcefield (Sec. 4.3)'                  ' Ranking methods based on'
        'Semi Empirical (Sec. 4.4)'              ' Ranking methods based on semi'
        'Wavefunction (Sec. 4.5)'                ' Ranking methods based on'
        'ML Potentials (Sec. 4.6)'               ' Ranking methods based on Ml potentials. Forcefields parametrised with ML, should be under the'
        'Other'                                  ' Any other method.'

save_

