        _enumeration_set.state 
        _enumeration_set.detail
        'intramolecular'                         ' used to describe the parametrisation of the intramolecular term in a forcefield.'
        'electrostatic'                          ' used to describe the parametrisation of the electrostatic term in a forcefield.'
